OL,3,GNEWSAGrooming gangs inquiry will 'shine
OL,4,Aa light' on Birmingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Birmingham
OL,7,FChildren's Trust has said a national
OL,8,Finquiry into grooming gangs will "shine
OL,9,Fa light on an issue that doesn't always
OL,10,Fget the attention it should".
OL,12,FJames Thomas said the organisation had
OL,13,Fbeen working with the Independent
OL,14,FInquiry into Grooming Gangs even before
OL,15,Fthe body announced this week that it
OL,16,Fwould expand its reach to include
OL,17,FBirmingham and Wales.
OL,19,FHe said the trust had known the inquiry
OL,20,Fwas looking at cases in the city, but
OL,21,Fhad not been given advance notice of
OL,22,Fthe announcement.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
