OL,3,GNEWSAGrooming gangs inquiry will 'shine
OL,4,Aa light' on Birmingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said grooming gangs were a problem
OL,7,Fin Birmingham "as they are in much of
OL,8,Fthe country".
